	"data": "Reference: bHaptics TactSuit — Linux Haptics\n\nHardware\nDevice: bHaptics TactSuit Air\nBLE dongle: TP-Link, attached to Windows VM at boot\nHost: [[infra/star]] (Linux, PipeWire audio)\n\nCurrent Working Pipeline (Windows VM required)\n\nScript: ~/bin/start-bhaptics-audio.sh\n\nLimitation\nAudio-to-Haptic in Surround mode requires Windows runtime. Currently running a VM just for this.\n\nProposed: Native Linux Daemon (bhapticsd)\nFull spec in notes/haptics-linux.md. Architecture:\nYAML profiles for motor…",
